{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "49f754cbfb211a6f72433e412c5d0b68f1aba7cb3bb1187a694ed96960a92481", "ja": "雑誌撮影前", "zh": "杂志拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6000_place", "source_sha256": "8a3122e45b14e571a445235aa3b24dbbaa744000fa64cc905ff7ae7a98bcb6f5", "ja": "動物園", "zh": "动物园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6001_p", "source_sha256": "f0efaf59df1b5f5754c1ca67043fea77c400b4ad116deceb539bda6073b1ab24", "ja": "（今日は動物園の全面協力の下、グラビア雑誌\n『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。伊織も準備万端だな）", "zh": "（今天要在动物园的全力协助下，为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄。伊织也已经准备万全了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6002_007ior", "source_sha256": "7671668ed53d3e2da9821cb9454778c60440b2e1170ac6648d6126260972b88a", "ja": "ふふっ、狐さん、こんにちは♪　今日はよろしくね。\n……警戒はされてない、かな。触ってもいいのかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，小狐狸，你好♪ 今天请多关照啦。\n……它应该没有在警戒吧。可以摸摸它吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6003_p", "source_sha256": "150084c8e91c967b8bc0420559c6bc8ace6f8623262b38ad2628c7ea84da718d", "ja": "おお、お疲れさま、伊織！\nもう狐のところに移動してたんだな。", "zh": "哦哦，辛苦了，伊织！  \n你已经移动到狐狸那边了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6004_007ior", "source_sha256": "93d8c073f8aeef024b1df8d851f961521bb20458d793ba7149b7437b817315eb", "ja": "きゃっ！？　な、なによアンタ、\n急に話しかけないでよ！　びっくりするでしょ！", "zh": "呀！？你、你干什么啊，\n别突然跟我说话！会吓到人的好不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6005_p", "source_sha256": "619a990e29be16e5b14fdab5cf80ec122768a82ad360bb9a00b707b77eef6164", "ja": "ご、ごめん。驚かすつもりは\nなかったんだけど、邪魔しちゃったかな。", "zh": "对、对不起。我不是故意要吓你的，只是……是不是打扰到你了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6006_007ior", "source_sha256": "0cb2b0280673f95dd9cc8cf8a01ac3bd71b3c22f1023181a9737391ba8c39c5d", "ja": "邪魔って……わ、私は仕事の準備をしてただけよ。\nほら、今日は狐の親子と一緒に撮影でしょ？", "zh": "说什么打扰……我、我只是在准备工作而已。你看，今天不是要和狐狸母子一起拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6007_007ior", "source_sha256": "5d20a17b6a9a04e20e0b7b5f377c4d1e020b40b4e4ae3fe830de4372ed09f526", "ja": "だから、先に挨拶をしてたのよ。\n仲良くなってた方が、良い写真が撮れそうでしょ？", "zh": "所以我才先跟它们打招呼的呀。\n先和它们处好关系，不是更容易拍出好照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6008_p", "source_sha256": "a783dc45801c66dbdf801d38e7a399115e885eab124b11ac11c94a66d1fe6ca9", "ja": "確かに、伊織の言う通りだな。せっかくだから、\n楽しそうなところを撮ってもらいたいし。", "zh": "确实，伊织说得对。难得有这个机会，\n也希望能拍出看起来很开心的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6009_007ior", "source_sha256": "47ec7a0156b881b0adafafee04b3e306d67e8d5f3c7407f8f167f7730c8894ed", "ja": "でしょ？　ふふん。じゃあ、私を驚かした責任として、\nどんな写真がいいか、アンタも考えなさい！", "zh": "对吧？哼哼。既然你要为吓到我负责，那就和我一起想想该拍什么样的照片吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6010", "source_sha256": "20e48a3c351c82c96655ddc85d94ca0742ccf28cd90445ada56a3926770f522a", "ja": "子狐を抱っこ", "zh": "抱起小狐狸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6011", "source_sha256": "223df5107e7b4eebbe2d3a161b40974982461ab552868fd6b17e86429e3e221e", "ja": "餌やり", "zh": "喂食", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6012", "source_sha256": "5b18ee9be1149c7e27124890699e295781f97acf3c9693453456db7c7a7bb53d", "ja": "一緒にステージ", "zh": "一起登上舞台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6100_p", "source_sha256": "14950646ca54cddeda29ada340536e29110cf59f1d09c8732f2f05d90dc443f4", "ja": "子狐を抱っこして撮影するのはどうかな？\nきっと可愛い写真が撮れると思うぞ！", "zh": "抱着小狐狸来拍照怎么样？\n肯定能拍出很可爱的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6101_007ior", "source_sha256": "8a6f32928bd322839df26e13bb7b1c4a1abfe9eceda3a767b3b628fe823f6919", "ja": "あら、いいじゃない！　ふわふわの子狐……\n実は、触ってみたかったのよね♪", "zh": "哎呀，挺不错的嘛！毛茸茸的小狐狸……\n其实，我本来就一直想摸摸看了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6102_007ior", "source_sha256": "a8300c2a80a148ed956321b38b8a1ecc9000ded1d3347efe233c4fd0590e22ba", "ja": "挨拶をしておいたのも、さっそく役に立ちそうだわ。\n最高の写真にするから、しっかり見てなさいよね！", "zh": "提前打过招呼，看来马上就能派上用场了。\n我会把它拍成最棒的照片，你可要好好看着哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6200_p", "source_sha256": "797bfd50ec7c7ffb18e0c216e6a9a4d1e48675bf06de38522cabd691cb86f9e8", "ja": "餌やりなんてどうかな？\n温かい雰囲気の写真が撮れると思うぞ。", "zh": "要不要试试喂食？我觉得应该能拍出充满温馨氛围的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6201_007ior", "source_sha256": "fd01001d3257399bae746c5e73d3ea5690bca9ed433622de9c24b88b15797cfe", "ja": "面白そうね！　狐に餌やりができる機会なんて、\nなかなか無いもの。喜んでくれるかしら♪", "zh": "听起来很有意思！能有机会给狐狸喂食，可不常见。它会不会很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6202_007ior", "source_sha256": "91aa75b47288a38b7600e3092764c0e609a0ba311b80f743fb39f24369815032", "ja": "でも、初めての相手だから、怖がって噛んじゃったり\nするかも……。アンタも、ちゃんとフォローするのよ！", "zh": "不过，毕竟是第一次接触，说不定它会害怕，咬人什么的……你也要好好帮忙照看哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6300_p", "source_sha256": "ee191578223e3f5823c944b51bfc563b0d0a98a026495fbff854fa693e668058", "ja": "伊織と狐の親子でステージをするのはどうだ？\nほら、一緒に踊ったり。絶対に可愛いぞ！", "zh": "让伊织和狐狸母子一起登台怎么样？  \n比如一起跳舞什么的。绝对很可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6301_007ior", "source_sha256": "14bf48cd19183e91c20e085b8dc484f8ef7af5ad003dda795614171f2975911d", "ja": "はあ……。アンタね、それで真面目に考えたの？\n狐の親子に失礼じゃない！", "zh": "唉……你啊，这就是你认真想出来的？  \n对狐狸一家也太失礼了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_6302_007ior", "source_sha256": "47717b487a3fe3eca8e6a485a4f7520e3ea5d96dc723b7b930f6b118daf47ee6", "ja": "かわいくても、無理をさせるなんてイヤよ。撮影どころ\nじゃなくなっちゃうわ。すぐに別の案を考えなさーい！", "zh": "就算很可爱，我也不想让它勉强自己。那样就没法拍摄了。赶紧想别的方案吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
